  "",
  "Safe to change: \"from\"/\"to\" (what is displayed), \"what\" (the sentence), \"where\",",
  "and the \"casa\"/\"ours\" name lists. Leave \"id\" alone -- status.json ticks are keyed on it.",
  "\"start\"/\"end\" are 24-hour and drive the day ordering and the now-marker; change them",
  "together with \"from\"/\"to\" or the page will say one time and sort by another.",
  "",
  "If this file is unreadable or has an empty session list the page falls back to the copy",
  "built into index.html, so a bad edit degrades to yesterday rather than to a blank page.",
  "",
  "WARNING, and it is the opposite of status.json: a rebuild OVERWRITES this file. Anything",
  "changed here is lost the next time the page is re-cut unless the same change is made in",
